    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_zip" kindref="compound">Zip</ref> ties two iterators together into a single iterator. The point is to enable the <ref refid="submodules_2mathicgb_2src_2mathicgb_2_range_8hpp_a29d045d9800793ef42fae9da995ce52b_1a29d045d9800793ef42fae9da995ce52b" kindref="member">zip()</ref> function defined further down in this header.</para>
<para>Note that equality is defined ONLY by equality of the first iterator! </para>
    </detaileddescription>
